data: {"id": "79dfa9cd5c704b2a-final", "run_id": "79dfa9cd5c704b2a", "seq": 1379, "ts_ms": 1789147109113, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v11/workload` | CreateContainerConfigError | aiops-case-v11/workload 处于 CreateContainerConfigError，持续 30 分钟，未启动。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubelet | `Warning Failed ... 28m (x12 over 30m) Error: couldn't find key unavailable-key in ConfigMap aiops-case-v11/workload-input` | 直接证实容器启动配置错误，指出缺失的具体键名 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Pod Status | `Pending` (Pod 处于等待状态) | 确认异常组核心现象，表明容器尚未启动成功 |\n| 3 | Metric | PromQL | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"CreateContainerConfigError\"} = 1` | 定量佐证 K8s Event 中的警告，明确等待原因为配置错误 |\n| 4 | K8s Config | Container Resources | `memory_request=8Mi`, `cpu_request=5m` (Context) | 排除资源限额引发的调度或启动限制，将排查聚焦于配置 |\n\n证据间高度一致：Metric 的 `CreateContainerConfigError` 状态与 K8s Event 中关于 ConfigMap 缺失 key 的 Warning 形成闭环，共同指向配置缺陷。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap aiops-case-v11/workload-input 定义不完整（缺少 key unavailable-key） → kubelet 验证容器配置时发现缺失 key → 容器创建失败，Pod 进入 CreateContainerConfigError 状态 → 用户可见 Pod 处于 Pending 状态，未启动\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因**：ConfigMap `aiops-case-v11/workload-input` 中缺少 Pod `workload` 容器配置所需的 key `unavailable-key`，导致 kubelet 在容器创建阶段拒绝启动。\n\n*   证据编号 #1 和 #3 直接指出了缺失的键名及对应的错误类型。\n*   证据编号 #4 排除了资源配置问题。\n\n**待确认事项**：业务逻辑期望 ConfigMap 包含的具体 key 集合。目前无法确定是 ConfigMap 遗漏了该 key，还是 Pod 配置错误地请求了该 key。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.5m\n├─ 问题定位: 14.9s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 65.1s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v11/workload: 65.1s (Evidence 56.2s, RCA 8.7s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 7.2s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v11/workload**: pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 87.163, "metrics": {"run_id": "79dfa9cd5c704b2a", "mttr": {"value": "1.5m", "seconds": 87.17041730880737, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-config-error", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-config-error"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 87170.41730880737, "llm_calls": 20, "llm_duration_ms": 82987.21981048584, "tool_calls": 19, "executed_tool_calls": 14, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 4, "successful_tool_calls": 18, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 9051.427841186523, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 3823.751211166382}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 14853.379726409912, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 65051.39350891113, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 7238.534450531006, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

